! ID TA000305  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 326"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 234751, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  47 lines, contiguous from 234751.00 to 235007.40 (a half
! word; next location 235010.00), then blank paper.  Line 15 is a
! remark card ("-" in the NAME field, "BINARY DATA CARD"), no location.
! "*" after the LOCATION on lines 8, 25 and 42.
!
! JOIN.  p.325 (scratch neighbour, not landed; Vision sheet) ends with
! B,ARNORM at 234750.40 and defines ARBCD6 at 234746.40 -- line 1's
! 234751.00 continues it.  p.327's sheet opens at 235010.00.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  TA000305 .. TA000349, 45 serials on 47 lines: lines 5
! and 6 (NOP, NOP) both print TA000309, lines 16 and 17 (Z,$5 / Z,$6)
! both print TA000319.  Recorded, not explained.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 7 "ARBCDC" (last glyph open) = ARBCDD: line 13 DEFINES
!     ARBCDD with both D stems plain at 900 dpi, and line 7's printed
!     second half 234762.74 is line 13's 234762.40.  D worn to C.
!   * line 16 label ARBDCD: C22-6728 names it ("The relocatable
!     binary data routine, ARBDCD").
!   * line 36 ARNORM and line 40 ANORMR: letter O (C22-6728 "ARNORM";
!     ANORMR's O prints closed at 900 dpi).  line 41 ARNRM1: C22-6728
!     "counted in the routine ARNRM1".
!   * hex bytes printed with open rounds ("CO" line 12, "CC" line 22,
!     "OF" line 45, "FC" lines 10 and 29-31) read 0, as the octal
!     fields of the same rows print 0 open.  Line 42's "C8" likewise
!     is 08 (C-I compiles 08, as the landed C-I rows at 216547.00 and
!     222141.40 print it).
!
! The loader's data block (ALL and the indicators SYN'd onto it,
! ALDCTR, AHIWD, ABT31, ARCDCT, ALDBF) is printed p.291 (staged); the
